{
  "_about": "Owner decision D-320 (11 Nov 2026, point 26): the one menu config. The left menu (13 entries) and every section's menu bar are built from this file by App\\Services\\Navigation (PHP) and src/services/navigation.js (Node). The file is the same, byte for byte, in both stacks (navigationConfig tests). A section owns the pages whose path starts with one of its prefixes (the longest prefix wins). 'count' on a section shows that count beside its left-menu entry on every page (Approvals, My tasks, Zoho waiting, settings near expiry). A section is shown when the person can open at least one of its items; its left-menu link is the first such item that opens in the same tab. 'when': any = at least one of these permissions, all = every one, flags = every one of these facts (worked out by each stack: superAdmin, sopOpen, approver, mod_<module>, div_gst, div_import_duty). 'count' names a live count. 'children' makes a drop-down. 'activeQuery' marks the item active only for these values of a query parameter ('' = not given). An item whose link has a #part is never marked active.",
